    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigemeng'hejo sha būtoolwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo shi badūgū bane mutamanile ī gīkī ī shilagīlo shikabizaga shinsugile ū munhū aho ataalī mpanga dūhū? Ū gwenūyū nalībawīla abo bashimanile ī shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlī gīt'ūmo nkīma akabizaga atungilwe na shilagīlo sha kwikala na ngoshi aho ataalī mpanga, ū ngoshi ūlū ūlinda ūcha, ū nkīma ng'wenūyo wīngaga ū mu shilagīlo sha ngoshi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ngoshi ūlū ataalī mpanga hūna ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūneka, ūja ūūkatoolwa na ngosha ūngī, akwitanwa nshihani; ūlū ūcha ū ngoshi akūbiza watungūlagwa ū mu shilagīlo shenīsho, nūūlū akatoolwa na ngosha ūngī atūbiza nshihani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īlī nū kū bing'we badūgū bane; a bing'we muchile ū kū shilagīlo īkī mulī mu mīlī go ng'wa Kilisito, mubize ba ng'wa ūngī, ūyo akajūūchiwa kūfuma mu bafu; gīkī tūntwagīje matwajo Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho twalī tūtaalī tūlondeela nhūngwa ja mīlī, ū kwikūmva kwa shibi ūko kwatūmamaga ū mu mibīlī yise kūlwa nguno ya shilagīlo, kwalītwagījaga matwajo ī licha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha tūtīmo ū mu shilagīlo, tūchile ū kū shikolo īsho shalī shitūtungile ī kale, tūdūle kūtūmama mu katongeelelwe kapya ka kūfuma kūlī Moyo, yaya a katongeelelwe a ka kale, a ka kūtongeelwa na wandīke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūzwanjiwa būbi bo mu gatī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī tūhaye ginehe hangī? Gīkī ī shilagīlo h'ī shibi? Na hado yaya! Nguno ūlū ni ītī mu nzīla ya shilagīlo ni natashimanile ī shibi; nū būbi wa kwikūmva ni natabūmanile ūlū ni shitī shilagīlo kūhaya gīkī, “Yaya ū kwikūmva.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī shibi shikashitūmamīla ī shilagīlo, ū mulī nene shūtūūla būlī mbika ya kwikūmva; nguno ūlū gatīho malange ī shibi shichile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya gīkī, naalī mpanga aho naalī natī ha sīlīlī ya malange; alīyo aho shiza shilagīlo, ī shibi shūpīmbūka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū nene nūcha. Na lūūlū ī shilagīlo īsho shalī shiigelile kūnenhela būpanga, shūningīja mu kūcha ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī shibi shikapandīka ng'wanya gwa kūnilemba lemba mu nzīla ya shilagīlo, shūnibūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a malange galī meela, na gatūngīlīgije, hama gawiza; nī shilagīlo sheela na shitūngīlīgije, nīyo shawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya gīkī ū mhayo gwawiza gūkabiza gwenha icha ū kūlī nene? Ītī gīko na hado yaya, alīyo ū mu kwiyoolecha gīkī ī shibi shilī shabūbi ng'hana, shikagūtūmamīla ū mhayo ū gwawiza, shūnenhela icha ū nene. Na lūūlū ū mu nzīla ya shilagīlo, ī shibi shūbiza gīkī shilī shabūbi kūheeba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno tūmanile gīkī a malange galī ga Kiimoyo, alīyo ū nene nalī wa nhūngwa ja kūlondeela mīlī; nagūjiwe kū būsese bo shibi, h'īsho shinisugile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno natagūmanaga ūyo nakagwītaga, nose natagwītaga ūyo natogilwe kūgwīta, alīyo ūyo nagūkolilwe h'ūyo nakagwītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū īkī nakagwītaga ūyo natagūtogilwe, ū mu gīko nakizunīlījaga na a malange, gīkī galī gawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya natī nene ūyo nakīītaga, alīyo ī shibi īsho shikikalaga mulī nene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno namanile gīkī ū mulī nene, ū mu būmunhū bone, būtikalaga mo wiza; īkī ū kūtogwa natogilwe, alīyo ū kwīta ū gwawiza nalemeelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalemeelagwa gete ū kwīta ī yawiza īyo nītogilwe, alīyo ī yabūbi īyo natītogagwa h'īyo nakīyītaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ūlū nakagwītaga ū mhayo ūyo natagūtogilwe, numho natī nene ūyo nakīītaga; alīyo ī shibi īsho shikikalaga ū mulī nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose nakūbonaga gīkī, ū mulī nene galīmo malange ayo gakūninhaga ng'hūmbū ja kwīta yawiza, alīyo būlīmo na būbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu gatī ya būmunhū bone, nagayegelile a malange ga ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nakūbonaga! Malange gangī, nago galīho gishishinīkile ū mu mīlī gwane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mīlī gwane:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, mabudīka ga mīlī gwane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " gakwilwishaga na a malange ga mu maganiko gane, ganīīta kūbiza nsese kū malange ga shibi īsho shilīmo ū mu mīlī gwane ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga, nashila būlī! Nani akūniguna nagūpūlūgūke ū mīlī gwa kūcha gwenūyū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu alūmve ū mulī Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito. Nguno ū būgima bo mhayo būlī gīkī, ū nene ū mu maganiko gane, nakagatūmamīlaga malange ga ng'wa Mulungu. Alīyo ū mu nhūngwa ja mīlī, nalī ha sīlīlī ya malange ga shibi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
